{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "subject": "你的 Capy Notebook 账户将于 {{.DeletionDate}} 删除",
  "preview": "如果这是误操作，请在此之前联系支持。",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "你的账户已安排删除"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "我们已收到你删除 Capy Notebook 账户的请求。你的账户现已锁定，并将在下方日期连同所有工作区、文件、资料和学习数据被永久删除。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "attrs": {
          "backgroundColor": "#fdf0ef",
          "borderColor": "#f2d4d1",
          "borderWidth": 1,
          "borderRadius": 10,
          "paddingTop": 14,
          "paddingRight": 16,
          "paddingBottom": 14,
          "paddingLeft": 16,
          "marginBottom": 20
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "删除日期："
              },
              {
                "type": "variable",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "DeletionDate",
                  "label": "Deletion date",
                  "required": true
                },
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "剩余天数："
              },
              {
                "type": "variable",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "GraceDays",
                  "label": "Grace days",
                  "required": true
                },
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " 天",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "改变主意了？请在 "
          },
          {
            "type": "variable",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "DeletionDate",
              "label": "Deletion date",
              "required": true
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 前联系支持，我们可以为你恢复账户。过了这个日期，所有内容都无法恢复。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "attrs": {
          "text": "联系支持",
          "url": "OpenURL",
          "isUrlVariable": true,
          "alignment": "left",
          "variant": "filled",
          "borderRadius": "smooth"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "horizontalRule"
      },
      {
        "type": "footer",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "你收到这封邮件是因为有人请求删除你的 Capy Notebook 账户。如果不是你本人操作，请立即联系支持。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
